### REST API Examples for spot_v0_bot
### Use with VS Code "REST Client" extension or copy curl commands

@host = 127.0.0.1
@port = 8000
@base = http://{{host}}:{{port}}
@token = REPLACE_WITH_API_TOKEN

### Health (requires token only if API_TOKEN is set)
GET {{base}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Spot status
GET {{base}}/spot/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Spot photo (JPEG). Change source as needed, e.g. hand_color_image
GET {{base}}/spot/photo?source=frontleft_fisheye_image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Power on + stand
POST {{base}}/spot/power_on_and_stand
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Navigate to waypoint (GraphNav must be loaded/localized)
POST {{base}}/spot/navigate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waypoint_id": "YOUR_WAYPOINT_ID"
}

### Say text on Spot (TTS -> play on robot)
POST {{base}}/spot/say
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hallo Spot!"
}

